# Versions

The catalog is a tree of snapshots. Uncommitted work stays on **head**
until Save. The UI word is **Save**, never Update. How the studio works:
[docs/studio.md](docs/studio.md). Language: `CONTEXT.md`.

## The rule

Every **Save** writes a **new node**, child of HEAD.

- **Shuffle of the layout seed, or an explore tile** is a **different
  planet**. Save is still a child. Commit/Adopt does not follow.
- **Layout genes, shape seed, shape genes, sculpting, body, a name** on
  this layout seed is the **same planet**. Save is still a child. Adopted
  follows that line when the save is on it.
- **A name** labels the node. It is not what makes a child.

Do not reuse a variant id for a later Save. Do not treat a node's Shape
sketch as stale — a child is a different snapshot and starts unshaped.
Explore likes may write **ranges** to HEAD as they go; that is not a save
of the planet.

## Language

**Save** — write the working planet as a new node, child of head.
_Avoid_: Update, commit

**Same planet** — same layout seed. Shape iteration stays here.
_Avoid_: Generation, in-place update

**Different planet** — new layout seed, or an explore tile.
_Avoid_: Fork, copy, save as (unless naming)
